{"chapter": "morphisms", "node_kind": "lemma", "parent_tag": "02G3", "placeholders": {"MATH_0001": "$f : X \\to S$", "MATH_0002": "$S$", "MATH_0003": "$f$", "MATH_0004": "$f$"}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{lemma}\n\\label{lemma-noetherian-unramified}\n", "suffix": "\\end{lemma}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:fd565504f9e95205624be6bb38f157401ad514610ecd77d0ee29bbd7623a40cc", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:c90c33194a7e5d5cdf163c706009a1cd015543a905f91db6b5939e7db97607e8", "source_text": "Let <MATH_0001> be a morphism of schemes. Assume <MATH_0002> is locally Noetherian.\nThen <MATH_0003> is unramified if and only if <MATH_0004> is G-unramified.\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:31a009c4111859e27d55deb9a385ecc15d3e0c99d5bdc62dc326227b3bd20faf", "unit_id": "tag:04EV:statement"}
{"chapter": "morphisms", "node_kind": "proof", "parent_tag": "02G3", "placeholders": {"REF_0001": "\\ref{lemma-noetherian-finite-type-finite-presentation}"}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{proof}\n", "suffix": "\\end{proof}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:44136fa355b3678a1146ad16f7e8649e94fb4fc21fe77e8310c060f61caaff8a", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:832fca5c61dc61a2565e8992cedf6f28ed3711b183ce27a509ece5ee2d015323", "source_text": "Follows from the definitions and\nLemma <REF_0001>.\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:3e69e564fa541e9d6d1271ac7680631a9eb0c072caf86b1107bddb5f068462b5", "unit_id": "tag:04EV:proof"}
{"chapter": "morphisms", "node_kind": "lemma", "parent_tag": "02G3", "placeholders": {}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{lemma}\n\\label{lemma-open-immersion-unramified}\n", "suffix": "\\end{lemma}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:44136fa355b3678a1146ad16f7e8649e94fb4fc21fe77e8310c060f61caaff8a", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:a8fba257b3d9bef5e1b6125ff6994c2613827805d2313b0523d41bedb52db8fd", "source_text": "Any open immersion is G-unramified.\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:5cb2f77d28542a584ed8bdf3259fb03e0ec81b1d31c795fb620e071944fca4ee", "unit_id": "tag:02GB:statement"}
{"chapter": "morphisms", "node_kind": "proof", "parent_tag": "02G3", "placeholders": {}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{proof}\n", "suffix": "\\end{proof}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:44136fa355b3678a1146ad16f7e8649e94fb4fc21fe77e8310c060f61caaff8a", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:930600167c0ad4c0b0b1da8d110cc726169cf4b77f4810609faf88f77878fa01", "source_text": "This is true because an open immersion is a local isomorphism.\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:acb4ec29b81aa746a58aa6944bf2eb44b4cbbc3550be451946e31155b346a9c6", "unit_id": "tag:02GB:proof"}
{"chapter": "morphisms", "node_kind": "lemma", "parent_tag": "02G3", "placeholders": {"MATH_0001": "$i : Z \\to X$", "MATH_0002": "$\\mathcal{I} = \\Ker(\\mathcal{O}_X \\to i_*\\mathcal{O}_Z)$", "MATH_0003": "$\\mathcal{O}_X$"}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{lemma}\n\\label{lemma-closed-immersion-unramified}\n", "suffix": "\\end{lemma}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:e60c19d558116b3e8c50d619c33ec28964f63085860bf7c9776114f007efc134", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:2f48fd2eac0bb634e2b3af35ed5643bc7ef1db2ca2e49c610eb4a1ec9c6f7f37", "source_text": "A closed immersion <MATH_0001> is unramified.\nIt is G-unramified if and only if the associated quasi-coherent sheaf of\nideals <MATH_0002>\nis of finite type (as an <MATH_0003>-module).\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:f95accf27814226fa77152a5cfd419911a87331d21bce8f01081c92b813af5ef", "unit_id": "tag:02GC:statement"}
{"chapter": "morphisms", "node_kind": "proof", "parent_tag": "02G3", "placeholders": {"REF_0001": "\\ref{lemma-closed-immersion-finite-presentation}", "REF_0002": "\\ref{algebra-lemma-unramified}"}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{proof}\n", "suffix": "\\end{proof}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:44136fa355b3678a1146ad16f7e8649e94fb4fc21fe77e8310c060f61caaff8a", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:41a1bdf6a4347bdb925ebd33b8fc97e5154ef7bf5cfd21eaa44c66cc23fcded2", "source_text": "Follows from Lemma <REF_0001> and\nAlgebra, Lemma <REF_0002>.\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:08141d011224b4da59ab491c41c4ce5f5cefd31152d560a10a3e6e8c3342f402", "unit_id": "tag:02GC:proof"}
{"chapter": "morphisms", "node_kind": "lemma", "parent_tag": "02G3", "placeholders": {}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{lemma}\n\\label{lemma-unramified-locally-finite-type}\n", "suffix": "\\end{lemma}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:44136fa355b3678a1146ad16f7e8649e94fb4fc21fe77e8310c060f61caaff8a", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:b220973fcd78c79aa4ef95abd38d1e1159f497ebfbb8afd56a5bf9fcc1a17545", "source_text": "An unramified morphism is locally of finite type.\nA G-unramified morphism is locally of finite presentation.\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:7dc7b16c0c36927dd5a6068d902d5797018793c9232e8dd7723c65c8a5a3368c", "unit_id": "tag:02GD:statement"}
{"chapter": "morphisms", "node_kind": "proof", "parent_tag": "02G3", "placeholders": {}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{proof}\n", "suffix": "\\end{proof}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:44136fa355b3678a1146ad16f7e8649e94fb4fc21fe77e8310c060f61caaff8a", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:930600167c0ad4c0b0b1da8d110cc726169cf4b77f4810609faf88f77878fa01", "source_text": "An unramified ring map is of finite type by definition.\nA G-unramified ring map is of finite presentation by definition.\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:7ceeb21dae6445708f7ffec84e161714dff703d27749fec272659f434ddb7668", "unit_id": "tag:02GD:proof"}
{"chapter": "morphisms", "node_kind": "lemma", "parent_tag": "02G3", "placeholders": {"MATH_0001": "$f : X \\to S$", "MATH_0002": "$f$", "MATH_0003": "$x$", "MATH_0004": "$f$", "MATH_0005": "$x$"}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{lemma}\n\\label{lemma-unramified-quasi-finite}\n", "suffix": "\\end{lemma}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:3fd90cf558e11245e714426c94f7f646155d8c683e3d0840b9b596c456216934", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:233acb07134ccb63bcac52b991791f722587e733adbf51d4b22e3491dfa10005", "source_text": "Let <MATH_0001> be a morphism of schemes.\nIf <MATH_0002> is unramified at <MATH_0003> then <MATH_0004> is quasi-finite at <MATH_0005>.\nIn particular, an unramified morphism is locally quasi-finite.\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:8cad9b0d94831cb43504ed8c680373826707dd673bd6e81b3fa863116c96f51f", "unit_id": "tag:02V5:statement"}
{"chapter": "morphisms", "node_kind": "proof", "parent_tag": "02G3", "placeholders": {"REF_0001": "\\ref{algebra-lemma-unramified-quasi-finite}"}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{proof}\n", "suffix": "\\end{proof}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:44136fa355b3678a1146ad16f7e8649e94fb4fc21fe77e8310c060f61caaff8a", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:c9c20b9fad51f282e086cff21e86b7d6b6e4a686106b0eff6bef49d9d1064d8f", "source_text": "See Algebra, Lemma <REF_0001>.\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:4079b6135ebc8cf861f7d37cfede939d163ace64668a28cd62a27ec8ae1b04fb", "unit_id": "tag:02V5:proof"}
{"chapter": "morphisms", "node_kind": "lemma", "parent_tag": "02G3", "placeholders": {"MATH_0001": "$X$", "MATH_0002": "$k$", "MATH_0003": "$X \\to \\Spec(k)$", "MATH_0004": "$X$", "MATH_0005": "$k$", "MATH_0006": "$f : X \\to S$", "MATH_0007": "$s \\in S$", "MATH_0008": "$X_s$", "MATH_0009": "$\\kappa(s)$", "STRUCT_0001": "\\begin{enumerate}", "STRUCT_0002": "\\item", "STRUCT_0003": "\\item", "STRUCT_0004": "\\end{enumerate}"}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{lemma}\n\\label{lemma-unramified-over-field}\n", "suffix": "\\end{lemma}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:2da7ef9c73938907d7c3ac09b3eb8db5da4d7e249aa5208bdfdc87ae70be99d4", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:b64d17862e7a4c790c09910eff6fe1e9b1b145503ed0411616622c47865c9441", "source_text": "Fibres of unramified morphisms.\n<STRUCT_0001>\n<STRUCT_0002> Let <MATH_0001> be a scheme over a field <MATH_0002>.\nThe structure morphism <MATH_0003> is unramified if\nand only if <MATH_0004> is a disjoint union of spectra of finite separable\nfield extensions of <MATH_0005>.\n<STRUCT_0003> If <MATH_0006> is an unramified morphism then for every <MATH_0007>\nthe fibre <MATH_0008> is a disjoint union of spectra of finite separable field\nextensions of <MATH_0009>.\n<STRUCT_0004>\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:2699f7fbad2e7aad4d736aa3802ff32ce0492fa7d083ab151a5139f0f48618f4", "unit_id": "tag:02G7:statement"}
